The legislative texts in this repository are from the Commonwealth Code of the Northern Mariana Islands published
by the CNMI Law Revision Commission, https://cnmilaw.gov. The laws of the Commonwealth are not copyrightable under
the government edicts doctrine (Georgia v. Public.Resource.Org, Inc., 590 U.S. 255 (2020)); see SOURCES.md. The
texts are reproduced without change to their wording; only the arrangement into files and lines is Lexifina's.
This repository is private.

Lexifina's own contributions (tools, file arrangement, commit messages and documentation) are dedicated to the
